  <ProductDescription ID="38383931" LongDesc="&lt;b&gt;StreamBoost&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Whether you’re looking to hard-wire your desktop or ensure a lightning-fast and reliable wireless connection for your gaming console, D-Link’s AC Dual Band Gigabit Gaming Router has everything a true gamer could ever want. The DGL-5500 is designed with the revolutionary Qualcomm StreamBoost technology to give unprecedented speed and connectivity for all the devices in your home network. StreamBoost identifies the devices and applications in your home network and uses its cloud-based intelligence to ensure an optimal network experience for your connected home. Utilizing cloud-based updates to automatically adapt your network, your router is never out of step with new devices or applications. To control it all, StreamBoost's easy-to-use web-based interface lets you see your whole home network at a glance. Faster, smarter networking for the connected home.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Backward Compatible&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;While the DGL-5500 delivers AC performance to your home network, it is also backward compatible with all of your existing 802.11 wireless devices. This means you can enjoy all the benefits of wireless AC without worrying about annoying compatibility issues. Simply use a browser or download the QRS app to your mobile device, follow the intuitive setup wizard, and you'll have your wireless AC home network up and running in minutes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Maximize your AC Performance&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;When it comes to wireless performance, it's important to make sure both your router and wireless receiver are the same tech standard so you can truly experience the power of AC. You can optimize your home network's performance by upgrading to an 802.11ac USB adapter on your desktop and laptop computers. By adding D-Link's AC1200 USB adapter (DWA-182) to your AC network, you can avoid speed bottle-necks and ensure that your network is running at it's full potential.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Dual Band Advantage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The DGL-5500 delivers Dual Band performance for intelligent, versatile, interference-free bandwidth. Check your email and surf the Internet on the 2.4GHz band; and game, make Skype calls and stream HD movies to multiple devices using the cleaner, interference-free band." ManualPDFSize="0" ManualPDFURL="" MiddleDesc="" PDFSize="0" PDFURL="" ShortDesc="Gaming Router AC1300 w/ StreamBoost, 4 x RJ-45, Gigabit Ethernet, Wi-Fi 802.11ac, Dual Band" URL="http://www.dlink.com/us/en/home-solutions/connect/routers/dgl-5500-gaming-router" WarrantyInfo="1-Year Limited Warranty" langid="1"/>
